Color-descriptor can be a few different things: black, red, btnface or a hexadecimal (i.e. $aabbcc).}}

{{note|When using hexadecimal you may get confused if attempting to use #RRBBGG standard as used in web pages. If you've got a hex value and want to use it with this function then swap the GG and RR, so an RGB value of #0099FF would be $FF9900 (GGBBRR)}}

